{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-05-26 22:55:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, LEADING INVESTOR COUNSEL, ENCOURAGES INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION INVESTORS WITH LOSSES TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - IBM', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION (NYSE: IBM) BETWEEN APRIL 4, 2017 AND OCTOBER 20, 2021,\xa0INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT JUNE 6, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE. SO WHAT:\xa0IF YOU PURCHASED IBM SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-05-26 05:45:00', 'title': 'IBM LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION ("IBM" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: IBM) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF IBM INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN APRIL 4, 2017 AND OCTOBER 20, 2021.'}